\\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{3}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true. As a result, $B={A}^{-1}$ and statement III is true too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AE=EA={I}_{3}.$ Computing $AE$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AE & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ -10 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{3}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348161 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2dd76501-c60c-5bce-9ffc-b4d3b28fd3bf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451705} {:answer/id #uuid "51753a09-2255-5845-8d27-ebe20a632dc9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451706}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2dd76501-c60c-5bce-9ffc-b4d3b28fd3bf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451705} :answer-field/id #uuid "03948866-0b24-52c3-8253-b493c8d73592" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452700} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3db9de1c-b97f-569b-b5d7-ee1b92b0f720" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451707} {:answer/id #uuid "fd503f10-de25-5ab0-bb92-dd3358bee9da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451708}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fd503f10-de25-5ab0-bb92-dd3358bee9da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451708} :answer-field/id #uuid "59605bbd-4695-50af-b923-5d960bdaa68e" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-fiel